---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <main id="main" class="page-shell prose-page">
    <a class="back-link" href="/">
      ← Home
    </a>
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      Hunmeng is a place to enjoy web novels in English. The project uses AI-assisted translation, editorial review, and publication only with verified permission from rights holders.
    </p>
    <p>Two original demo stories are currently available. Their authors are fictional, and source links are examples. Published translations will include author and source information.</p>
    <p>You can read without an account. Your settings, library, and reading position are saved in your browser. Learn more in the <a href="/rules/">terms and privacy</a>.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
